/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (At the core of our robot, we designed a custom Zero PCB with the Raspberry Pi as the central controller. This board integrates power distribution, sensor connections, and communication lines into a single compact system, reducing wiring complexity and improving reliability. It mitigated messy wiring and helped us avoid wiring issues. Using the Cirkit Designer IDE, we were able to ensure elaborate and proper wiring. )
